= Per-File and Third-Party Notices =

A source file ported from kmscon or libtsm keeps the copyright notice that
file carried, beside vtium's. A third-party component's notice, such as the
GNU Unifont font's (SIL OFL 1.1) or the Unicode data tables' (Unicode License
v3), is added here with the code or data it covers, when that is ported.
